      "widgets_values": [
        "## Character Sheet from an image\n\nTurns one picture of a character (a photo, an illustration, or even a rough doodle) into a character sheet: four turnaround views and six expressions, stitched into one image.\n\n**How to use:** load your picture in **Load Image** and run. The sample is a generated street photo; the workflow removes the background and keeps the photo look. One character per picture works best; if only the upper body is visible, the legs and shoes are invented.\n\n**What you get** in `output/character_sheet/`:\n\n- `sheet_*.png`: front, three-quarter, side and back views on top, six expressions below\n- `front_*.png`: the clean front view on its own, a good first frame or reference for image-to-video\n\n**Time:** 10 images per run. The three views run in parallel, then the six expressions run in parallel, so a run usually takes a few minutes.\n\n**Redo one panel:** edit that node's prompt (even one word) and run again. Only the changed panel and the sheet are regenerated; the other panels come from the cache.\n\n**Model:** every node uses `Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo`, which runs about twice as fast as the base model. Switch a node to `Qwen-Image-2.1` to get the `steps` slider.\n\n**One-time setup.** This workflow uses the Video Factory Qwen-Image 2.1 node; if ComfyUI reports it missing, install it from the Manager. Register at https://h3.oneclickamd.ai/?src=character-sheet, then save your key to `h3_gateway_api_key.txt` in the ComfyUI user directory (or set `H3_GATEWAY_API_KEY`). On the Windows Desktop app use the file, for example `C:\\Users\\<you>\\AppData\\Local\\Comfy-Desktop\\ComfyUI-Installs\\ComfyUI\\ComfyUI\\user\\h3_gateway_api_key.txt`. If the key is missing, the first node fails right away and names the exact file it looked for.\n\n**Your key is not in this workflow**, so the workflow and the images it saves are safe to share.\n\n**From FlowFactory:** more ready-to-run workflows at https://github.com/wangxunx/FlowFactory\n\n---\n\n**中文说明：** 在 Load Image 里换成你的角色图（照片、插画、草图都行），直接运行即可。输出在 `output/character_sheet/`：`sheet` 是完整设定图（上面四视图，下面六个表情），`front` 是单独的正面全身图，可直接作为图生视频的首帧。每次运行生成 10 张图。想重做某一格，改一下那个节点的提示词再运行，其他格子走缓存，不会重新生成。\n\n更多开箱即用的工作流见 FlowFactory：https://github.com/wangxunx/FlowFactory"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
