      "widgets_values": [
        "Character design reference sheet panel. Redraw the character from the image as a clean full-body front view. Keep exactly the same face, hairstyle, ears, outfit, colors and body proportions. If the input is a rough drawing, render it as a clean, polished illustration; if it is a photo, keep it photorealistic. Standing upright with the body, head and eyes squarely facing the viewer and looking straight ahead, shoulders level, arms relaxed at the sides, toes pointing toward the viewer, feet slightly apart, calm neutral expression. Keep any item the character holds or carries. Show the whole body from head to toes, centered, on a plain pure white background with soft even studio lighting. No text, no background objects, no extra characters.",
        "9:16",
        "Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo"
      ],
      "title": "Front view",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
