      "widgets_values": [
        "Turn the character's entire body 180 degrees so we see the character from directly behind, in a full back view. Everything faces away from the viewer: the back of the head and hair, the back of the outfit, the backs of the legs and knees, and the heels of the shoes; the toes point away from the viewer. The face and everything on the front of the character, such as a beard, buttons or front decorations, are hidden. Anything worn on the back, such as a cape, hood, backpack or tail, is clearly visible. If the character has a tail, the whole tail is shown attached to the lower back and clearly visible against the white background. Standing upright with arms relaxed, feet slightly apart. The second image is the original picture of the same character; use it only to see details that the first image hides, such as a backpack, cape or tail. Keep exactly the same character: same face, hairstyle, ears, outfit, colors, body proportions and art style, and any item the character holds or carries. Whole body visible from head to toes at the same scale, centered, on a plain pure white background with the same soft even lighting. No text.",
        "9:16",
        "Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo"
      ],
      "title": "Back view",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
